Hanzi-Writer data is derived from Make Me A Hanzi data (https://github.com/skishore/makemeahanzi).
Make Me A Hanzi data is extracted from the Make Me A Hanzi project by Shaun Kishore.
The stroke order data is licensed under the ARPHIC public license (http://ftp.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/f/fonts-arphic-ukai/fonts-arphic-ukai_0.2.20080216.1.orig.tar.gz).
